#: ../../source/docs/commonmission-planner-command-line-interface-cli.rst:5
#: b8e5e9ec9d794682bd9cef7a669c5470
msgid "Mission Planner Command Line Interface (CLI)"
msgstr "Mission Planner 命令行界面（CLI）"

#: ../../source/docs/commonmission-planner-command-line-interface-cli.rst:9
#: 47e3473c362c47c2a8160faea0e4dd3b
msgid ""
"The CLI is being phased out on all platforms. The features were massively "
"cut down with AC3.1.5 and then it was removed for the APM2 completely anyway"
" with AC3.2. All CLI functions are now available via regular MAVLink "
"commands in the GCSs. This article has been moved to the dev wiki and may be"
" considered deprecated."
msgstr ""
"CLI 正在所有平台上逐步淘汰。其功能在 AC3.1.5 中大幅削减，随后在 AC3.2 中彻底从 APM2 上移除。所有 CLI "
"功能现在均可通过地面站的常规 MAVLink 命令实现。本文已移至开发 wiki，可视为已废弃。"

#: ../../source/docs/commonmission-planner-command-line-interface-cli.rst:16
#: 80768372a64d4d6892be142207840f85
msgid "Using the Mission Planner serial terminal"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 串行终端"

#: ../../source/docs/commonmission-planner-command-line-interface-cli.rst:18
#: a7f1bdc51ff84981b1d162550ee08e82
msgid ""
"The Terminal tab is visible on the top icon row when “Advanced View” is "
"checked in the Config tab."
msgstr "在「配置」选项卡中勾选「高级视图」后，顶部图标行将显示「终端」选项卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/commonmission-planner-command-line-interface-cli.rst:24
#: 728e7d741804469485fe3169417b7619
msgid ""
"The Mission Planner serial terminal is the best a way to see text data "
"coming from APM via its USB port and to type commands into the CLI. You can "
"can also run tests and download and analyze log files from this screen."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 串行终端是查看 APM 通过 USB 端口发来的文本数据，以及向 CLI "
"输入命令的最佳方式。还可在此界面运行测试并下载和分析日志文件。"
